    "q-115248": {
      "dom_id": "step-q115248",
      "name": "Question 16",
      "problem": "Solve the inequality ${7}^{x+1}>{5}^{x-1}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Taking the natural logarithm of both sides and applying the laws of logarithms, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{7}^{x+1} & >{5}^{x-1} \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡({7}^{x+1}) & >\\operatorname{ln}⁡({5}^{x-1}) \\\\ (x+1)\\operatorname{ln}⁡7 & >(x-1)\\operatorname{ln}⁡5 \\\\ x\\operatorname{ln}⁡7+\\operatorname{ln}⁡7 & >x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5-\\operatorname{ln}⁡5 \\\\ x\\operatorname{ln}⁡7-x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5 & >-\\operatorname{ln}⁡5-\\operatorname{ln}⁡7 \\\\ x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡7-\\operatorname{ln}⁡5) & >-\\operatorname{ln}⁡5-\\operatorname{ln}⁡7 \\\\ x & >-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5+\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7-\\operatorname{ln}⁡5} \\\\ x & >\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5+\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5-\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-115248-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x>\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7+\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}",
              "html": " <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"151\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>7</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>5</mn></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
